From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: youss17x <youss17x@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:29:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PC5: ddraw's SetClipStatus is quiet (Wine patch 0950)

Project IGI calls IDirect3DDevice7::SetClipStatus twice a frame. Wine's
implementation returns D3D_OK and logged a FIXME, which filled the log (the
two calls pass different pointers, so only one collapsed). The FIXME is a
TRACE. Nothing is stored, and GetClipStatus is unchanged. Not tried on a
console.
---
